  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.skiron_satyrikos.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.skiron_satyrikos.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_skiron_satyrikos"><head>ΣΚΙΡΩΝ ΣΑΤΥΡΙΚΟΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="fragment-skiron_satyrikos-dindorf1893_grc1-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_skiron_satyrikos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.skiron_satyrikos.nauck1889grc1:675">
            <note type="source">Poll. On. IX, 75.</note>
            <quote>
              <lg type="fragment">
                <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">τάχα δ᾽ ἂν εἴη κόρη,</l>
              </lg>
            </quote>
            <note type="commentary">ὡς Εὐριπίδης ὠνόμασε παρθένον ἐν Σκίρωνι, λέγων περὶ τῶν ἐν Κορίνθῳ ἑταιρουσῶν·</note>
            <quote>
              <lg type="fragment">
                <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ τὰς μὲν ἄξει, πῶλον ἦν διδῷς ἕνα,</l>
                <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">τὰς δὲ ξυνωρίδ᾽, αἱ δὲ κἀπὶ τεσσάρων</l>
                <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">φοιτῶσιν ἵππων ἀργυρῶν· φιλοῦσι δὲ</l>
                <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">τὰς ἐξ᾽ Ἀθηνῶν παρθένους, ὅταν φέρῃς</l>
                <l n="6" xml:lang="grc">πολλάς</l>
              </lg>
            </quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="fragment-skiron_satyrikos-dindorf1893_grc1-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_skiron_satyrikos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.skiron_satyrikos.nauck1889grc1:676">
            <note type="source">Poll. On. X, 35.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Τῶν ἀδοξοτέρων ἡ χαμεύνη καὶ τὸ χαμεύνιον. ἐν γοῦν τῷ Σατυρικῷ Σκίρωνι Εὐριπίδης φησί·</note>
            <quote>
              <lg type="fragment">
                <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Σχεδὸν χαμεύνη σύμμετρος Κορινθίας</l>
                <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">παιδὸς, κναφάλου δ᾽ οὐχ ὑπερτείνεις πόδα.</l>
              </lg>
            </quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="fragment-skiron_satyrikos-dindorf1893_grc1-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_skiron_satyrikos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.skiron_satyrikos.nauck1889grc1:677">
            <note type="source">Athen. IX, p. 368 D.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Σκείρωνι (sic)</note>
            <quote>
              <lg type="fragment">
                <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὐδὲ κωλῆνες νεβρῶν.</l>
              </lg>
            </quote>
            <note type="commentary">Εὐριπίδης</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="fragment-skiron_satyrikos-dindorf1893_grc1-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_skiron_satyrikos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.skiron_satyrikos.nauck1889grc1:679">
            <note type="source">Athen. III, p. 76 C.</note>
            <note type="commentary">τῶν δ᾽ ἐρινῶν σύκων (μνημονεύει) Εὐριπίδης ἐν Σκίρωνι</note>
            <quote>
              <lg type="fragment">
                <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἡ προσπηγνύναι</l>
                <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">κραδαῖς ἐριναῖς·</l>
              </lg>
            </quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="fragment-skiron_satyrikos-dindorf1893_grc1-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_skiron_satyrikos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.skiron_satyrikos.nauck1889grc1:678">
            <note type="source">Stobæus XLVI, 10.</note>
            <quote>
              <lg type="fragment">
                <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">ἔστι τοι καλὸν</l>
                <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">(τοὺς) κακοὺς κολάζειν.</l>
              </lg>
            </quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" xml:id="fragment-skiron_satyrikos-dindorf1893_grc1-6" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0006_skiron_satyrikos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.skiron_satyrikos.nauck1889grc1:681">
            <note type="source">Cf. Palamed. fgm. XI.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Ἔμβολα</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
